---
description: Elixir, Ecto and LiveView conventions for Cuckoding
globs: **/*.{ex,exs,heex}
alwaysApply: false
---

- Supervise long-lived workers; keep domain rules outside LiveViews.
- SQLite owns state. Write events and projections atomically; broadcast afterward.
- Use changesets and bound external values; never create atoms from model input.
- Subscribe to PubSub only when connected; reload committed state after reconnect.
- Authorize every mutation and escape repository/agent content.
- Preserve forms/focus across live updates; stream/paginate long activity lists.
- Launch commands as validated executable/argv, never interpolated shell strings.
- Run relevant RTK-wrapped formatter, compiler, tests and static analysis.
